= Relations with [+ president +]

Our relationship with President [+ president +] can be described as wary as best, due to our diametrically opposed ideals. However, if we are to make any solid reforms, or even hold any chance of sustained government, we will need to at least have dealings with [+ president +].

- @president_funds: Arrange some meetings with the President.
- @president_less: Utilise our influence [? if president_party != spd_name : with the [? if president_party == ddp_name : Z ?][? if president_party == "Z" : [+ ddp_name +] ?][? if president_party == bvp_name : Z ?][? if president_party == "DVP" : [+ ddp_name +] and Z ?][? if president == "Hindenburg" : Z ?] ?] to sway the President.
